OL,3,AEbola vaccine trial to start in DR
OL,4,ACongo as warning issued over speed of
OL,5,Ainfections
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democratic Republic of the Congo is
OL,8,Fgearing up to roll out an Ebola vaccine
OL,9,Fwith some doses being used as part of a
OL,10,Ftrial to see if it is effective against
OL,11,Fthe Bundibugyo species of the virus
OL,12,Fthat is currently circulating in the
OL,13,Fcountry.
OL,15,FThe Ervebo vaccine does help protect
OL,16,Fagainst the Zaire species of Ebola but
OL,17,Fcurrently there are no proven vaccines
OL,18,For treatments for Bundibugyo.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
