OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEbola vaccine trial to start in DR
OL,4,ACongo as warning issued over speed of
OL,5,Ainfections
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe rollout comes as the World Health
OL,8,FOrganization (WHO) issued a new warning
OL,9,Fthat Ebola was "growing exponentially"
OL,10,Fin the north and east of DR Congo and
OL,11,Fthe spread of infections now covered an
OL,12,Farea bigger than France.
OL,14,FClose to 2,500 people have now died in
OL,15,Fthis outbreak, which was declared three
OL,16,Fmonths ago.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
